@Host = http://localhost:5088
# Paste the output of ./build/local/New-LocalToken.ps1 (customer 42).
@Token = paste-a-token-here
# Use a new key per order; send the same key again to retry that order safely.
@IdempotencyKey = 6f5b2a6e-0d7c-4d0a-9a3e-2f1c8b7d9e01

### Place an order (products 1-3 and WELCOME10 are seeded by src/dbOrder/up/*.ENV.LOCAL.sql) → 201 + Location
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/order
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json
CorrelationId: {{$guid}}
Idempotency-Key: {{IdempotencyKey}}

{
  "customerEmail": "customer@example.com",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 2 }
  ],
  "paymentMethod": "CreditCard",
  "promotionCode": "WELCOME10"
}

### Same request and Idempotency-Key again → the original order, no second charge (Idempotent-Replayed: true)
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/order
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json
CorrelationId: {{$guid}}
Idempotency-Key: {{IdempotencyKey}}

{
  "customerEmail": "customer@example.com",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 2 }
  ],
  "paymentMethod": "CreditCard",
  "promotionCode": "WELCOME10"
}

### Expired promotion code → 400 with the error on promotionCode
POST {{Host}}/api/v1/order
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json
CorrelationId: {{$guid}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "customerEmail": "customer@example.com",
  "items": [ { "productId": 3, "quantity": 1 } ],
  "paymentMethod": "PayPal",
  "promotionCode": "EXPIRED20"
}

### One order (use the id from the Location header)
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/order/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json
CorrelationId: {{$guid}}

### Order history for the token's customer
# Next page: add &cursor=<nextCursor of the previous response>
GET {{Host}}/api/v1/order/by/customer/42?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json
CorrelationId: {{$guid}}

### Liveness (no headers required)
GET {{Host}}/healthz/live

### Readiness: SQL Server reachable (no headers required)
GET {{Host}}/healthz/ready

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{Host}}/metrics
